{"type": "say", "text": "Good afternoon, everyone. Thank you for joining me for this review meeting. As you know, the eighth-grade civics class has proposed an oral-history project where students would interview community members about local history. Before I can approve this project, I need to hear findings from each of you — the project advisor, the counselor, and the instructional technology coordinator. Let's go through the draft plan together. The current proposal calls for 20 student interviewers, audio recording on personal phones, publication of all recordings on the public school website, and indefinite retention of the files. I'd like to start by hearing from each of you regarding any concerns or recommendations you have about this plan."}
```

